      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "My book comes out tomorrow, so this is the last day to qualify for the pre-order bonus: a fun 10 minute AI voice interview that gives you personalized prompts, ideas, & readings based on concepts from the book\n\nYou can order & claim the pre-order bonus here: co-existence.ai",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3myai6h4uzc2x",
